  "solution": {
    "text": "The orbital where the last electron enters defines the block in the periodic table where the elements belong to:<br />&nbsp;<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 280px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Atomic number</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Block</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Electronic Configuration</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>37</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>-block</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>Ar</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>1</mn></msup></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>78</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>Pt</mi></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></math>-block</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>Xe</mi><mo>]</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mn>14</mn></msup><mn>5</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>9</mn></msup><mn>6</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>1</mn></msup></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>52</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>Te</mi></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></math>-block</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>Kr</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>5</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>65</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>Tb</mi></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></math>-block</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>Xe</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mn>9</mn></msup><mn>6</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table>"
